$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Place: <f0> The swimming pond out back" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear and dry as hell" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Dusk" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Remember the good old days when you use to go down to the old neighborhood pond and fish and swim all day long? Well, niether do I. However, The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have taken that old pond and drained all the water out of it just so they can kill eachother over some silly smelly flag." @
         "\n\n<f1>Mission designed by:<f0> EEPROM (Mappers Extreme)";

